        {
          "text": "Mwirinde ubganyu, muzigame n’ubusho bgose Mpwemu Yera yabashizemwo, ngo mube abo kubuzēzwa, kugira ngo muragire ishengero ry’Imana, iryo yaguze amaraso yayo. ",
