        },
        {
          "text": "Nabahaye akarorero muri vyose, yuko mu butame nk’ubgo, ari ko mukwiye gufasha abadakomeye, no kwibuka amajambo y’Umwami Yesu, ingen’ ubgiwe yavuze, ati Gutanga kuzana umugisha, kuruta guhabga.",
